  "translation": "Pikinini bilong eti yia mi stap long dispela de; inap mi ken save skelim bitwin gutpela na nogut? Inap save bilong yu i ken teste ⟨את⟩ olgeta samting we mi kaikaim, na ⟨את⟩ olgeta samting we mi dring? Inap mi ken harim moa long nois bilong ol man singa na ol meri singa? Na bilong wanem save bilong yu i ken kamap moa long karim hevi long bikman bilong mi, king?",
